  "description": "Master umbrella spec for Creative Claw: a local-first agentic creative suite forking OpenClaw (the spine) and transplanting Polymathes' GPU broker + visual memory and the four compiled-C++ creative engines (image/audio/video/vector) with their batch + node-graph + agentic-edit surfaces. Defines the unified product, sequences the three integration specs (gpu-broker → visual-memory → creative-engines), and settles cross-cutting decisions: native-desktop vs browser shell, packaging/provisioning, the unified agent experience, and the Stage-1→Stage-2 product arc."
